    title: "SCIP importer maps a Rust free function to kind=method (52/52 on aardvark-dns); derive kind from the descriptor chain's parent (ADR-0057 built-in default depends on it)"  # 85e2
    status: todo_hard  # 85e2
    priority: 3  # 85e2
